# L99 Deep Investigation Mode — ALWAYS ON

**Mandate (user):** Work in L99 thinking / max investigation / deep-search mode **everywhere, every turn**. Never shallow-guess.

## Default behaviour (every prompt)
1. **Assume L99** — dual-app classify (`BOTH` | `MASTER_ONLY` | `STABLE_ONLY`), run/consider `l99-dual-app-enrich-gates`, flow L99, sacred-couple gates when touching devices/flows/CI.
2. **Deep search first** — forum silent multi-scan, T140352 + satellites, Z2M/ZHA/Hubitat/Homesuite/deCONZ/Johan PRs-issues, Gmail diags when relevant. Cross-ref **manufacturerName + productId** only.
3. **Recursive TX/RX** — settings → ZCL/EF00 → clusters → capabilities → flows → mfs_db/registry/compose. Fix root cause, not symptoms.
4. **Silent enrich** — implement in code/CI; **never** auto-post Homey forum (T157628). Publish Homey Test when asked to push/publish.
5. **WHY (P215)** — Pourquoi / Comment / Pour qui / Quand / Contre quoi before non-trivial changes.
6. **Verify** — critical gates + L99 green before claiming done; push/publish when user asks.

